OL,3,AAnalysis: Trump's shock Russia deal
OL,4,Ahighlights mounting pressure to curb
OL,5,Afuel prices
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe deal comes as Trump is still
OL,8,Fgrappling with the political fallout of
OL,9,Fthe Iran war and its impact on global
OL,10,Fenergy prices, weeks before American
OL,11,Fvoters head to the polls in the midterm
OL,12,Felections.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
