OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS unveils sanctions on ICC in move
OL,4,Acourt condemns as 'assault on rule of
OL,5,Alaw'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe ICC said the measures were an
OL,8,Fassault on the rule of law and the
OL,9,Ffoundations of the international legal
OL,10,Forder.
OL,12,FThe announcement came just hours after
OL,13,Fformer ICC judge Navi Pillay was
OL,14,Fawarded the 2026 Nobel Peace Prize for
OL,15,Fher efforts to promote peace and
OL,16,Finternational law.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
