OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice say they have denied permission
OL,8,Ffor the gathering and all roads leading
OL,9,Fto Jantar Mantar, the main protest
OL,10,Fvenue, have been closed with huge metal
OL,11,Fbarricades.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
